# Raw scrape cache (events/venues/genres JSON) — regenerated by scraper/fetch_shows.py.
# The normalized, website-ready data under data/normalized, data/venues.json and
# data/days IS committed; only the bulky raw cache is ignored.
data/raw_pages/

# Claudinite vendored mount (mount/DESIGN.md at the canon): .claudinite/* is
# ignored wholesale, re-including the two tracked trees — shared/ (the vendored
# canon, refreshed by the nightly maintenance) and local_packs/ (this repo's own
# packs). The hooks-log lines keep the durable hook log untracked.
/.claudinite/*
!/.claudinite/shared/
!/.claudinite/local_packs/
/.claudinite-hooks.log
/.claudinite-hooks.log.tmp

# Python bytecode cache
__pycache__/
*.pyc
